  "summary": "<p>Marco Rubio, Secretary of State</p>\n\n<section class=\"wp-block-default-hero-container wp-block-default-hero-container--no-featured-content \">\n\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-default-hero module featured-content page-header \">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"row bc_row\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"row\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"featured-content__copy\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"featured-content__headline stars-above\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tEarthquake in Panama\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-meta\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- get document type -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta doctype-meta\">Press Statement</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__audience\"></p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__location\"></p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__publish-date\">October 9, 2026</p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"page-header__actions\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"classic-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-classic\">\n<p>I am closely monitoring reports of the earthquake in southern Panama. The United States stands with the people of Panama.</p>\n<p>At the request of the Panamanian government, the State Department is rapidly mobilizing resources and personnel to assist.</p>\n<p>Our consular affairs hotline is available 24/7 for affected Americans in need of support at +1-202-501-4444 from abroad and +1-888-407-4747 from the U.S. and Canada.</p>\n<p><input type=\"hidden\" data-filter=\"111001000111\" /></p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:70px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>",
  "content": "<p>Marco Rubio, Secretary of State</p>\n\n<section class=\"wp-block-default-hero-container wp-block-default-hero-container--no-featured-content \">\n\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-default-hero module featured-content page-header \">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"row bc_row\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"row\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"featured-content__copy\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"featured-content__headline stars-above\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tEarthquake in Panama\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-meta\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- get document type -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta doctype-meta\">Press Statement</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__audience\"></p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__location\"></p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__publish-date\">October 9, 2026</p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"page-header__actions\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"classic-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-classic\">\n<p>I am closely monitoring reports of the earthquake in southern Panama. The United States stands with the people of Panama.</p>\n<p>At the request of the Panamanian government, the State Department is rapidly mobilizing resources and personnel to assist.</p>\n<p>Our consular affairs hotline is available 24/7 for affected Americans in need of support at +1-202-501-4444 from abroad and +1-888-407-4747 from the U.S. and Canada.</p>\n<p><input type=\"hidden\" data-filter=\"111001000111\" /></p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:70px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>",
